cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Clinical KG Agent
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ahmed
    family-names: Ghita
repository-code: https://github.com/AhmedGhita95/Clinical-KG-Agent
abstract: >-
  Clinical KG Agent turns a clinical-scene video into a validated, queryable
  knowledge graph. A vision-language model proposes typed instances and
  relations, which are accepted only if they conform to the HORUS ontology.
  Validated assertions are serialized as RDF and queried with SPARQL.
keywords:
  - knowledge graph
  - ontology
  - OWL
  - RDF
  - SHACL
  - SPARQL
  - vision-language model
  - semantic validation
  - clinical scene understanding
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-09-09'
references:
